WEBVTT

00:14.180 --> 00:17.350
<i>He is Ranma of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i>

00:18.309 --> 00:19.352
Get off.

00:21.229 --> 00:23.857
<i>She is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.</i>

00:23.940 --> 00:25.108
What are you doing?

00:25.900 --> 00:29.070
<i>The two of them are now engaged
due to their parents' decision.</i>

00:29.154 --> 00:30.488
Don't decide who I'll marry.

00:30.572 --> 00:31.698
It's irritating.

00:31.781 --> 00:34.451
<i>And Ranma has a problem.</i>

00:35.076 --> 00:36.286
What the hell are you doing?

00:37.120 --> 00:40.832
<i>He transforms into a girl
when he's splashed with water.</i>

00:46.296 --> 00:50.550
RANMA1/2

02:14.134 --> 02:15.343
School?

02:15.426 --> 02:16.636
I HATE MEN!

02:16.719 --> 02:18.555
I've decided
we'll be staying here for a while.

02:18.638 --> 02:20.431
- For real?
- For real.

02:20.515 --> 02:22.600
It's the same school Akane and I go to.

02:22.684 --> 02:23.726
I'll see you later.

02:23.810 --> 02:25.520
Wait up, Nabiki.

02:25.603 --> 02:27.522
- I'm going with--
- What are you saying?

02:27.605 --> 02:29.732
Ranma's your fiancé.

02:29.816 --> 02:32.402
Make sure to take him to school with you.

02:32.485 --> 02:35.530
Besides, it's such a pain to go with you.

02:41.953 --> 02:43.413
Let me make it clear.

02:44.330 --> 02:45.790
We're complete strangers.

02:45.874 --> 02:47.750
Of course.

02:47.834 --> 02:50.295
Don't act like you know me at school.

02:50.378 --> 02:51.880
Oh, please. Who would?

02:52.463 --> 02:55.967
In the first place,

02:56.050 --> 02:58.428
I really, really hate violent women like--

02:59.470 --> 03:01.014
What the hell was that for, Old Man?

03:01.097 --> 03:04.309
As if a fool like you could ever have
your pick of women. You moron!

03:04.851 --> 03:05.852
Listen up, Ranma.

03:05.935 --> 03:09.647
Let me tell you one thing!

03:14.027 --> 03:16.154
What's wrong, Old Man?

03:16.237 --> 03:17.989
Try saying something now.

03:19.824 --> 03:21.701
- Bring it on.
- Hey.

03:25.663 --> 03:27.707
Look! A cat's doing a crab walk.

03:29.292 --> 03:30.960
Fly, you baldie!

03:36.257 --> 03:37.508
Take that you--

03:41.930 --> 03:43.181
What are you doing?

03:43.681 --> 03:45.391
- Going home.
- Hold up.

03:45.475 --> 03:47.518
I'll go back and take a bath.

03:47.602 --> 03:48.770
You're going to be late.

03:48.853 --> 03:51.105
No way I'm going to school as a girl!

03:51.606 --> 03:52.815
Fine.

03:53.399 --> 03:56.778
You'll turn back into a boy
if you're splashed with hot water, right?

03:56.861 --> 03:58.947
OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC - CHIROPRACTOR
ACUPUNCTURE - ACUPRESSURE

03:59.030 --> 04:00.448
So that's what happened.

04:00.949 --> 04:03.868
Hot water? Just a moment, Akane.

04:03.952 --> 04:04.953
Thank you.

04:05.453 --> 04:06.496
Someone she knows?

04:07.080 --> 04:10.500
Geez, this entire morning
has been nothing but bad luck.

04:11.042 --> 04:12.210
This sucks.

04:24.722 --> 04:26.224
Oh, my apologies.

04:28.101 --> 04:29.477
It's nothing scary.

04:29.560 --> 04:32.063
This is Betty, the skeleton specimen.

04:39.612 --> 04:41.155
Ranma, your hot water.

04:41.239 --> 04:42.615
Hey, Akane.

04:42.699 --> 04:44.242
Dr. Tofu.

04:46.953 --> 04:48.496
Good morning.

04:48.579 --> 04:49.622
Morning.

04:52.083 --> 04:53.793
I haven't seen you lately.

04:53.876 --> 04:55.253
You haven't been getting hurt?

04:55.837 --> 04:56.838
No, I haven't.

04:57.422 --> 05:00.425
Because I'm not doing anything
that would get me injured.

05:01.801 --> 05:05.138
Since you seem pretty busy too, Dr. Tofu.

05:05.638 --> 05:06.806
Yeah...

05:09.309 --> 05:10.768
<i>Aha</i>.

05:12.854 --> 05:14.230
Who was that guy?

05:14.314 --> 05:17.025
Dr. Tofu, the chiropractor. He's famous.

05:17.525 --> 05:18.568
He's strong, ain't he?

05:18.651 --> 05:20.445
Wow, you can tell?

05:22.113 --> 05:24.032
<i>He completely snuck up on me.</i>

05:24.115 --> 05:26.409
<i>I couldn't sense a thing.</i>

05:27.118 --> 05:29.370
He doesn't look strong, right?

05:29.454 --> 05:33.499
I've been going to his clinic
for all my injuries since I was a kid.

05:33.583 --> 05:34.834
That so?

05:37.086 --> 05:39.797
So? Isn't he a man?

05:39.881 --> 05:40.882
What?

05:40.965 --> 05:43.593
Didn't you hate men?

05:46.387 --> 05:47.764
That's right.

05:48.389 --> 05:50.725
I really hate...

05:52.727 --> 05:54.604
<i>Akane Tendo's here.</i>

05:54.687 --> 05:56.981
FURINKAN HIGH SCHOOL

05:57.774 --> 05:59.650
- What?
- ...men!

05:59.734 --> 06:01.527
- Akane Tendo!
- I'm not gonna let you in!

06:01.611 --> 06:02.862
I'm coming for you!

06:02.945 --> 06:04.405
You go over there.

06:10.036 --> 06:11.913
Move. You're making me late.

06:21.172 --> 06:22.965
Come at me!

06:24.884 --> 06:26.010
Akane--

06:26.094 --> 06:27.595
I'll stop you with my raw stren--

06:27.678 --> 06:30.973
If someone's gonna beat you,
it's gonna be me!

06:35.561 --> 06:38.940
Your sister's got it tough every morning.

06:39.440 --> 06:40.733
It's Ranma.

06:40.817 --> 06:42.360
Ranma!

06:42.443 --> 06:44.237
Come inside the building.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.571
But...

06:45.655 --> 06:48.199
Akane's got it all under control.

06:48.741 --> 06:49.742
Whoa.

06:57.834 --> 07:00.419
Sheesh. They're so annoying,
doing this every morning.

07:00.503 --> 07:01.504
Honestly.

07:02.088 --> 07:03.506
What horde of boorish men.

07:06.676 --> 07:11.222
It appears they plan to request a date
if they best you in combat.

07:13.057 --> 07:15.518
Tatewaki-senpai. Good morning.

07:15.601 --> 07:16.727
What?

07:16.811 --> 07:19.063
The school bell will ring soon.

07:21.190 --> 07:23.401
Before that, allow me to challenge you.

07:24.652 --> 07:26.446
You're kinda popular, aren't you?

07:26.529 --> 07:28.448
Get out of the way. You'll get hurt.

07:29.031 --> 07:31.033
So what's this about?

07:31.117 --> 07:32.201
What do you mean?

07:32.285 --> 07:33.619
You there.

07:33.703 --> 07:35.371
What?

07:35.455 --> 07:37.874
You are behaving
too familiarly with Akane.

07:37.957 --> 07:39.125
That's 'cause...

07:39.625 --> 07:41.627
- Right?
- What do you mean "right"?

07:41.711 --> 07:43.880
Who exactly are you?

07:45.381 --> 07:49.135
- I'm--
- But it's polite to state my name first.

07:49.218 --> 07:51.387
All right! I shall start
by telling you my name.

07:53.473 --> 07:55.391
- Go ahead.
- Right.

07:56.017 --> 07:58.227
I am Tatewaki Kuno of class 2-E.

07:58.311 --> 08:00.730
The undefeated captain of the kendo club

08:00.813 --> 08:03.566
and the newest rising star
of the high school kendo world,

08:03.649 --> 08:04.859
otherwise known as,

08:05.610 --> 08:08.321
The Blue Thunder of Furinkan High School!

08:12.283 --> 08:14.660
He said he's "The Blue Thunder."
Ever heard of that?

08:14.744 --> 08:15.870
It's a first for me.

08:16.496 --> 08:20.374
Well, I'm staying at Tendo Dojo.

08:20.458 --> 08:22.877
Wait. What did you just say?

08:22.960 --> 08:24.962
What? I'm staying...

08:25.046 --> 08:26.881
- At?
- ...Tendo Dojo.

08:26.964 --> 08:28.132
You bastard!

08:28.216 --> 08:31.093
I'm the 2nd generation of the Saotome
School of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

08:31.177 --> 08:35.306
You live with Akane under the same roof?

08:38.601 --> 08:39.977
- Hold this.
- Hey.

08:41.187 --> 08:42.563
I'm Ranma Saotome.

08:43.689 --> 08:45.483
I accept your challenge!

08:56.369 --> 08:59.080
Look. Someone's gonna fight Tatewaki.

08:59.163 --> 09:00.540
Ain't that bad?

09:01.165 --> 09:03.668
You libertine, clinging to Akane.

09:04.168 --> 09:06.546
I, Tatewaki Kuno, shall punish you!

09:06.629 --> 09:08.172
Who's clinging to her?

09:08.256 --> 09:10.508
He's just a freeloader.

09:10.591 --> 09:11.968
Talking is unnecessary.

09:12.468 --> 09:13.678
Chest!

09:23.938 --> 09:27.066
You know,
I don't want you getting any wrong ideas.

09:27.567 --> 09:30.611
<i>Wow.
He instantly got right into his chest.</i>

09:30.695 --> 09:35.783
I don't like Akane
even one teeny, tiny bit.

09:35.866 --> 09:38.035
<i>He's good.</i>

09:38.536 --> 09:42.164
That violent, pig-headed,
stubborn, pouty girl

09:42.248 --> 09:44.417
who isn't even cute,

09:44.500 --> 09:46.043
- you can just have her--
- What? You perv!

09:46.127 --> 09:47.295
Don't call me that!

09:47.795 --> 09:49.505
To be so rude to Akane!

09:50.089 --> 09:51.173
Unforgivable!

10:08.983 --> 10:09.900
Mr. Saotome?

10:13.195 --> 10:14.822
Tatewaki got beat up by a panda!

10:14.905 --> 10:17.116
- That panda's so strong.
- What just happened?

10:17.617 --> 10:20.411
PE EQUIPMENT

10:26.584 --> 10:27.835
Damn it.

10:28.336 --> 10:30.671
If not for the rain,
I would've won with just one punch.

10:30.755 --> 10:33.049
I don't know about that.

10:33.132 --> 10:34.634
What do you mean?

10:34.717 --> 10:36.010
Your neck.

10:37.470 --> 10:38.721
A bruise.

10:39.764 --> 10:40.765
<i>That moment.</i>

10:42.516 --> 10:44.977
Pretty good
for not being able to lay a hand on me.

10:45.061 --> 10:46.979
He would've cut you a new one if he did.

10:47.480 --> 10:49.273
At best, wasn't it a draw?

10:50.566 --> 10:51.692
Really?

10:54.528 --> 10:57.198
BUFOON

10:57.281 --> 11:00.910
That's pretty impressive.
You didn't feel a thing, right?

11:01.952 --> 11:05.206
I thought Ranma Saotome was pretty decent,

11:05.289 --> 11:07.208
but he spelled it wrong!

11:07.291 --> 11:09.377
- This is how you write it.
- No, it's this.

11:09.460 --> 11:10.544
BUFFOO

11:10.628 --> 11:12.338
I really hate you.

11:12.421 --> 11:13.506
That makes me so happy.

11:15.216 --> 11:17.676
Well, so,

11:17.760 --> 11:22.390
Ranma recently moved here from China.

11:23.099 --> 11:25.810
Putting that aside,

11:26.685 --> 11:32.358
since he and Akane Tendo were both late,
stand outside.

11:34.777 --> 11:35.778
This is all your fault.

11:35.861 --> 11:37.863
Hey, I just got dragged into your fight.

11:37.947 --> 11:41.200
Not to brag, but I always
beat them up before the bell rings.

11:43.577 --> 11:45.704
What the heck was all that about?

11:46.205 --> 11:47.748
It's all because of Tatewaki-senpai.

11:48.249 --> 11:49.875
What did you say?

11:49.959 --> 11:53.170
If you want to date Akane,
you must best her in a fight!

11:53.254 --> 11:57.174
All other forms
of courting her are unacceptable!

11:58.217 --> 12:00.177
- ...is what he said.
- I see.

12:00.761 --> 12:02.179
What?

12:02.263 --> 12:03.931
Her fiancé?

12:04.014 --> 12:08.185
Yeah. Our parents decided
to get them engaged.

12:08.269 --> 12:11.063
That damn Ranma Saotome!

12:11.730 --> 12:13.691
Tatewaki. Go stand in the hallway.

12:19.488 --> 12:20.656
<i>What is he? Superman?</i>

12:21.365 --> 12:22.825
Unforgivable!

12:24.493 --> 12:27.455
So you fight Tatewaki every morning?

12:27.538 --> 12:29.665
And I win every time. Somehow.

12:29.748 --> 12:32.209
Fighting girls does rust your skills.

12:32.293 --> 12:33.544
Don't insult me.

12:33.627 --> 12:35.212
Want to see who's really stronger?

12:35.296 --> 12:36.881
No way.

12:36.964 --> 12:39.925
No matter how violent you are,
you're still a girl.

12:40.009 --> 12:41.886
- I can't fight you serious--
- I see.

12:41.969 --> 12:42.803
What?

12:42.887 --> 12:46.891
If that's what you're gonna say,
why don't we fight girl-on-girl?

12:51.228 --> 12:53.439
Ranma Saotome, I will never forgive you.

12:53.522 --> 12:54.815
What the hell are you doing?

12:54.899 --> 12:55.941
Tatewaki-senpai.

12:56.025 --> 12:57.902
I refuse to accept that you're engaged...

12:57.985 --> 12:58.986
Hey!

12:59.069 --> 13:00.946
...to Akane!

13:04.116 --> 13:05.993
What? They're engaged.

13:06.076 --> 13:08.662
No way, Akane.
Didn't you say you hate men?

13:08.746 --> 13:10.372
No. We're not, no.

13:10.456 --> 13:13.125
That's just what our parents said--

13:13.209 --> 13:15.336
We're the Furinkan High School
Broadcast Club.

13:15.419 --> 13:16.837
What is this about an engagement?

13:16.921 --> 13:17.922
- Who are you?
- Hey.

13:18.005 --> 13:22.426
We are extremely curious about
who will win Akane Tendo's heart.

13:22.510 --> 13:25.888
Like I said,
we didn't know a thing about it.

13:30.851 --> 13:31.977
You bastard.

13:32.561 --> 13:33.896
Running away? You coward!

13:33.979 --> 13:37.358
As if we could have
a real fight here. Follow me.

13:37.441 --> 13:38.692
As you wish.

13:38.776 --> 13:39.860
This is getting fun.

13:39.944 --> 13:42.613
So whoever wins gets to date Akane?

13:42.696 --> 13:44.865
- What?
- <i>What?</i>

13:44.949 --> 13:46.951
Please tell us what you're feeling.

13:47.451 --> 13:48.536
Shut up!

13:48.619 --> 13:51.539
Hey, you two! Don't run in the halls!

13:52.414 --> 13:54.667
Let's leave through a shortcut.

13:55.501 --> 13:56.752
All right.

13:56.835 --> 13:58.754
They both jumped out the window!

13:59.338 --> 14:01.173
But we're on the third floor!

14:01.966 --> 14:03.259
How are you both feeling?

14:03.842 --> 14:04.927
It's all good.

14:06.428 --> 14:07.513
Crap!

14:08.097 --> 14:10.891
Luckily, the pool is directly under them.

14:10.975 --> 14:12.768
- What a relief.
- That idiot.

14:12.851 --> 14:14.562
No way!

14:15.980 --> 14:17.022
Wow.

14:17.106 --> 14:18.357
That was flashy.

14:18.440 --> 14:20.317
- That was so loud.
- Incredible.

14:21.068 --> 14:23.070
Look, it's Tatewaki-senpai.

14:23.153 --> 14:24.530
How is he?

14:24.613 --> 14:26.991
Where's Ranma? Is he okay?

14:28.701 --> 14:31.453
<i>This is bad. I gotta get out of here.</i>

14:41.589 --> 14:43.465
<i>Guess I've got no choice.</i>

14:44.633 --> 14:46.010
Tatewaki-senpai's on the move.

14:46.093 --> 14:47.303
He's so skilled.

14:47.386 --> 14:48.804
How creepy.

14:53.601 --> 14:56.020
Ranma...

14:56.812 --> 15:00.232
I challenge...

15:00.316 --> 15:01.609
- What?
- His secret's out.

15:01.692 --> 15:03.152
Is that Ranma?

15:03.235 --> 15:05.654
- I challenge...
- Get off me, you damn bastard!

15:05.738 --> 15:08.032
This blockhead. Get a grip--

15:13.871 --> 15:17.082
You bastard!

15:18.542 --> 15:20.878
He's gone! He ran away!

15:20.961 --> 15:22.755
Ranma ran away like a rabbit.

15:22.838 --> 15:25.007
- Hey, didn't Ranma's...
- He's as fast as the racer, Ayrton.

15:25.090 --> 15:26.926
...body look like it shrunk?

15:31.972 --> 15:33.974
That was definitely a woman.

15:34.516 --> 15:35.935
Which means...

15:36.518 --> 15:39.396
That damn Ranma Saotome ran away!

15:44.026 --> 15:45.277
Damn it.

15:45.361 --> 15:49.073
That idiot Tatewaki
really gave my chest a good squeeze.

15:49.156 --> 15:51.492
So disgusting.

15:52.326 --> 15:54.620
He definitely figured out my secret.

15:55.621 --> 15:56.789
You careless idiot.

15:57.873 --> 15:59.375
What do you want, Akane?

15:59.458 --> 16:01.669
You really are stupid, you know.

16:01.752 --> 16:03.754
Jumping into the pool all on your own.

16:03.837 --> 16:05.297
Shut up!

16:05.381 --> 16:07.633
Did you come here just to say that?

16:07.716 --> 16:09.259
You buffoon.

16:09.343 --> 16:11.887
So that's all you have to say?

16:11.971 --> 16:14.056
Guess I'll just throw away this hot water.

16:14.139 --> 16:16.850
Hot water. Whoa.

16:17.810 --> 16:19.353
Idiot. Bully.

16:19.436 --> 16:20.813
Ranma!

16:22.189 --> 16:23.482
It's Tatewaki-senpai.

16:23.565 --> 16:26.026
Where are you, Ranma Saotome?

16:26.110 --> 16:27.569
- Take this.
- What?

16:31.573 --> 16:33.409
Tatewaki-senpai, I challenge you.

16:34.910 --> 16:35.911
Akane.

16:35.995 --> 16:38.831
I can't believe
you challenged me to a fight.

16:40.249 --> 16:41.667
All right. I accept.

16:41.750 --> 16:43.919
I shall go out with you if you win.

16:44.003 --> 16:46.088
I will do my best to lose.

16:46.171 --> 16:48.424
I'm not asking you out!

16:49.216 --> 16:53.429
<i>Ranma, transform back
into a boy while I distract him.</i>

16:54.263 --> 16:57.016
What are you expecting from me?

17:19.705 --> 17:20.914
You're that girl from earlier.

17:20.998 --> 17:23.625
Why are you still like that?

17:23.709 --> 17:25.377
Not like I can help it!

17:26.045 --> 17:29.381
Have you seen a strange boy with pigtails?

17:31.341 --> 17:32.676
That coward.

17:33.177 --> 17:35.054
He ran away in the middle of a fight.

17:35.137 --> 17:37.264
No doubt he was intimidated
by my strength.

17:37.347 --> 17:38.974
That spineless wimp is no man.

17:39.058 --> 17:40.726
Not a man!

17:40.809 --> 17:41.643
Fine.

17:44.813 --> 17:47.149
How dare you say
whatever you want when I'm being quiet?

17:47.232 --> 17:48.484
That hurts, you know.

17:49.151 --> 17:51.028
I won't run away or hide.

17:51.612 --> 17:54.656
I shall fight you wherever,
whenever you want.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.450
Come at me.

18:04.833 --> 18:05.918
How interesting.

18:06.460 --> 18:09.213
All right.
I shall go out with you if you win.

18:10.089 --> 18:14.176
I ain't asking you out!

18:15.969 --> 18:17.805
<i>So strong.</i>

18:19.681 --> 18:22.267
<i>As strong as Akane.</i>

18:23.560 --> 18:27.189
<i>No. Even stronger.</i>

18:32.611 --> 18:34.029
Let me tell you one thing.

18:36.281 --> 18:38.784
Ranma Saotome is much stronger than me.

18:42.579 --> 18:43.872
Okay, time to go home.

18:43.956 --> 18:47.167
We're still in the middle of class.
First period hasn't even ended yet.

18:47.251 --> 18:48.544
Oh, really? Well, who cares.

18:48.627 --> 18:50.796
- <i>Who is she?</i>
- What do you mean "who cares"?

18:53.715 --> 18:58.637
Ranma, it sounds like
Akane was a big help to you at school.

18:58.720 --> 19:01.056
I never asked her to.

19:01.640 --> 19:04.810
Akane, you could've just ignored him.

19:04.893 --> 19:08.397
Who cares if he turned into a girl?

19:08.480 --> 19:12.276
Yes, yes, it doesn't matter to you.

19:12.359 --> 19:16.864
But as his fiancée,
I'll be stuck with a bad reputation.

19:16.947 --> 19:19.783
I don't want people to think
I'm also a perv who will burst

19:19.867 --> 19:23.078
into the bathroom
when someone's taking a bath.

19:24.413 --> 19:27.291
<i>Damn it. As if I'll thank her.</i>

19:28.542 --> 19:29.376
FURINKAN HIGH SCHOOL

19:29.459 --> 19:30.294
What?

19:30.961 --> 19:33.130
Yeah, I know her.

19:33.213 --> 19:35.132
The pigtailed girl in a Chinese dress.

19:35.215 --> 19:38.010
Are you telling the truth, Nabiki Tendo?

19:38.093 --> 19:39.136
Yep.

19:40.637 --> 19:41.638
Tatewaki?

19:47.853 --> 19:52.441
<i>Don't think you can get away
with beating me, Tatewaki Kuno.</i>

19:52.524 --> 19:54.109
<i>Just wait and see.</i>

19:58.155 --> 19:59.364
TO THE PIGTAILED GIRL

19:59.448 --> 20:00.824
For you.

20:00.908 --> 20:02.409
For me? From Tatewaki?

20:02.492 --> 20:04.536
He said it's for the girl you.

20:04.620 --> 20:07.289
It didn't seem like
he thinks you're the same person.

20:08.582 --> 20:14.379
"Come to Furinkan High School's
second ground at 10:00 a.m. on Sunday."

20:14.922 --> 20:16.298
It's a challenge letter.

20:16.381 --> 20:18.634
Since he hates losing.

20:18.717 --> 20:20.844
He really holds a grudge.

20:21.345 --> 20:23.805
Seriously? What an annoying guy.

20:32.189 --> 20:34.274
How brave of you to come, pigtailed girl.

20:34.358 --> 20:36.735
You never learn, huh?

20:38.028 --> 20:39.821
Where's your wooden sword?

20:41.114 --> 20:42.699
I have no need for it.

20:43.909 --> 20:45.786
I see you're quite confident.

20:46.662 --> 20:47.788
Pigtailed girl.

20:50.123 --> 20:51.500
What I have

20:52.751 --> 20:54.503
to give you is

20:55.504 --> 20:56.713
this!

21:09.518 --> 21:10.519
I love you.

21:22.781 --> 21:23.907
No way...

22:56.917 --> 23:01.922
Subtitle translation by: Annie Chen
